(P/'README.md').write_text('''# R30: retire procedural ambience over the launch menu

The production candidate now suspends LivingWorld ambience while StartMenu owns display. This retires the extra bubble FV-286EA25FDB27, sparkle FV-D4719703FA36 and idle moon FV-2FA8B6B257A3 from the menu scope, including Options and saved-game confirmation. The unchanged painted boot background supplies its existing bubbles/glints. No new pixels or generation were needed. The same shared designs still have other consumers; three startup roles are not three globally accepted removals.

[R29 exact context](CONTEXT_PREREQUISITE.json) was anonymously verified before editing:57 files. The [baseline negative](BASELINE_NEGATIVE.json) fails three meaningful checks on unchanged production. The fixed [focused checks](FOCUSED_GATES.json) pass menu long idle, exit to sibling and reentry; all100 catalog contracts remain. The change is4 production lines plus36 probe lines. [Exact diff](source_change.diff), [source bindings](SOURCES.json).

[Current captures](CAPTURE_INDEX.json):78 actual official Godot4.7.2 Mobile/Speedy native files/78 unique byte hashes at1280x720/1600x720, four fresh/legacy-saved profiles,18 directly inspected views. They cover26second menu idle, raw engine touch Options/music/cancel/KeepGame/Continue and gameplay owner restoration. Focus notifications and menu reentry are explicitly diagnostic calls; actual OS focus, full reset/natural relaunch, saved DayOne Continue, device/child/owner and DL-QA-11 challenge remain open. [Contract](CAPTURE_CONTRACT.json), [ten-axis review](REVIEW.json).

Initial missing-Options-target46 frames and raw missing-vs-false-map comparison78 frames are archived and excluded,124 total. Source inspection and raw maps prove that Options saving fills false friend keys without earned progress; the final fixture compares exact earned flags/pearls/stars/masks and preserves marker12345. All normal8 save hashes and teardown pass. [Recovery](SETUP_RECOVERY.json). No failed frame earns context or art credit.

[Full validation](FULL_VALIDATION.json):all82 current trusted native probes pass withzero exits,including new menu regression and existing new-game/save/DayOne/Opera/sibling coverage. Official import and parser/inference/analyzer pass; tracked1998 sidecars restored exactly,1102 changed by import; normal saves unchanged. [Static gates](STATIC_GATES.json) pass exactengine/parity/gold-star catalogue;16 stale assessments remain explicit,not new scores. [Machine gates](GATES.json), [manifest](MANIFEST.json), [anonymous receipt](REMOTE_VERIFICATION.json), [receipt gates](RECEIPT_GATES.json). Exact-head CI/integration remains separately tracked; this topic candidate is not a dev/master release.

[Tally](tally.json):225 known roles/30families,54 partly reviewed existing roles/12families,78/176 route records partial/98 without/0 complete.2826 bounded historical context credits/3233 retained native files,407 excluded.369 primitive scopes:18 inventory-dispositioned/351 unresolved,plus2 supplemental compositors. One hand/four context requests pending. New bounded retirement lane:3 startup roles/1 route,all human/device/QA11/globalcaller acceptance open. Global approved/integrated/runtime-verified artwork/accepted removed:0; whole-game piece/screen/regression totals unknown. Strict game-wide2D satisfaction remains open.

Other StartMenu UI adornments, ghost-hand/glyph/material scopes remain inventory work. The actual MUSIC_OFF view shows a missing combining U+0338 glyph box; [source-bound remaining observation](REMAINING_UI_OBSERVATIONS.json) records it without inventing a new art design or regression count. This repair does not claim a zero-art launch screen or full-game completion.
''',encoding='utf-8',newline='\n')
